Device Code Flow
sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI
    participant Server
    participant User
    participant OAuthProvider

    CLI->>Server: POST /auth/device/start
    Server->>Server: Generate codes
    Server-->>CLI: device_code, user_code, verification_url

    CLI->>User: "Enter code XYZ at https://example.com"

    User->>OAuthProvider: Visit verification URL
    User->>OAuthProvider: Enter user code
    OAuthProvider->>User: Show authorization
    User->>OAuthProvider: Approve
    OAuthProvider-->>Server: Webhook: code approved

    loop Device polling
        CLI->>Server: POST /auth/device/poll (device_code)
        alt Not approved yet
            Server-->>CLI: status: pending
        else Approved
            Server-->>CLI: status: completed, access_token
        end
    end

    CLI->>CLI: Store credentials